## Seventh sprint execution, 2026-08-11 (system-wide zero-trust audit)

12-agent phalanx per the new SWARM.oot doctrine. All read-only. Findings written for grok to solve. **Total: 9 CRIT, 24 HIGH, 12 MED, 3 LOW surfaced in the audit proper; plus 7 CRIT, 4 HIGH, 3 MED, 1 LOW from the untracked-file scan. 50+ CRIT total.**

Per new SWARM.oot §6 doctrine: 3 Engineering Core + 4 Adversarial QA + 3 Integration + 2 Command. Each agent owned an orthogonal slice. Findings are folded below by agent.

### Engineering Core

**DE1 — Capability model ([12 findings, 3 CRIT, 5 HIGH, 4 MED])**

| # | Sev | File:line | Gap | Fix for grok |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1.1 | CRIT | `ooda/runtime/chs_rt_host.c:25-46` | `oo_host_ast_dump`, `oo_host_check`, `oo_host_token_dump`, `oo_chs_build` take no `cap` param and never `oo_cap_require_ffi` | Add `long long cap` to each signature; call `oo_cap_require_ffi(cap, "<op>")` at function entry |
| 1.2 | CRIT | `ooda/runtime/chs_rt_fs.c:99-111` | `oo_env_get` calls raw `getenv`, bypassing the `OODA_`/`OO_` policy allowlist | Replace `getenv(key.data)` with `oo_process_policy_getenv(key.data ? key.data : "")` |
| 1.3 | CRIT | `ooda/runtime/chs_rt_hitl.c:75-90` | `hitl_audit_open` uses raw `getenv("HOME")` | Replace with `oo_process_policy_getenv("HOME")`; reject `.ooda/audit.log` branch if HOME empty |
| 1.4 | HIGH | `ooda/runtime/chs_rt_sys.c:17-45`, `chs_rt_ffi.c:17-37`, `chs_rt_libfloor.c:13-34`, `chs_rt_time_rand.c:13-36`, `chs_rt_v2.c:13-51` | 5 cap-init sites still use racy `int g_*_ready` | Replace each with `static pthread_once_t g_*_once = PTHREAD_ONCE_INIT;` + `pthread_once(&g_*_once, once_*_init);` (mirror `chs_rt_alloc.c:14`) |
| 1.5 | HIGH | `ooda/runtime/chs_rt_sys.c:35-38` (and 5 other TUs) | Every cap token has only 32 bits of entropy | Use all 8 bytes of `b` for the per-token mask: `g_tok_fs = 0x1000000000000000LL | ...` |
| 1.6 | HIGH | `ooda/runtime/chs_rt_alloc.c:79-92` | `oo_free_bytes` with `p >= quota` clamps quota to 0 (DoS) | Reject if `p > quota`; only reclaim what was allocated |
| 1.7 | HIGH | `ooda/runtime/chs_rt_alloc.c:66-77` | `oo_list_ambient_quota += n` can overflow | Clamp to `LLONG_MAX` after add |
| 1.8 | HIGH | `ooda/runtime/chs_rt_sys.c:107-138` | `oo_sys_exec` `fork()` inherits full env | Build filtered env before `execvp`: copy only `OODA_*`/`OO_*` keys |
| 1.9 | HIGH | `ooda/oodac/check_cap_util.oo:78-173` | `is_sealed_sys` lists `async_spawn` but NOT `async_join` or `python_embed` | Add the two missing names to `is_sealed_sys` |
| 1.10 | MED | `ooda/runtime/chs_rt_ffi.c:87-124` | FFI handle table read/mut without lock | Add `pthread_mutex_t g_ffi_handles_mu` |
| 1.11 | MED | `ooda/runtime/chs_rt_hitl.c:38-63` | `g_audit_key` plaintext leaks into `fork()` children | Add `atfork_child_pre` that zeroizes `g_audit_key` |
| 1.12 | MED | `ooda/runtime/chs_rt_alloc.c:68-77` | `oo_list_quota_init_public` runs under mutex acquisition path | Move init to `__attribute__((constructor))` |

